":"and a refusal of every relaxation the base specs permit. Encoding them as one profile rather","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"than a dozen independent booleans means an operator cannot register a client that is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"nearly"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" FAPI, and a reviewer can answer “is this client financial-grade?” by reading one","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"field. The same philosophy as the rate-limit postures: ordinary clients see no behaviour","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"change at all, because "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"Self::Standard","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" is the serde default and every row"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"written before schema v38 decodes to it."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/ClientProfile","title":"ClientProfile","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","type":"topic"},"Self::Standard":{"identifier":"Self::Standard","title":"Standard","url":"Self::Standard","titleInlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Standard"}],"type":"link"}}}